# Shell scripts must stay LF everywhere — Cowork's sandbox runs them under dash,
# which aborts on CRLF (see cowork-field-reports 2026-08-19: log-event.sh became a
# blanket PreToolUse blocker after an autocrlf=true checkout rewrote it to CRLF).
*.sh text eol=lf

# Keep JSON/MD normalized in the repo; checkout eol doesn't matter for these.
*.json text
*.md text
